layer0 background: noise texture, brightness based on ambient light
layer0 display segments: all segments black with some low alpha
layer1 ambient occlusion: blurred black layer1 mask
layer0 needle back-illumination: blurred red*illum needle
layer0 markings: bright colors with alpha for intensity (background must be darker)
layer0 displays: bright color * intensity
layer0 needles: brightness based on illumination and ambient light
layer1 background: noise texture, brightness based on ambient light
layer1 indicator segments: all indicators black with some low alpha
layer1 needle back-illumination: blurred red*illum needle
layer1 markings: bright colors with alpha for intensity (background must be darker)
layer1 indicators: bright color + glow, alpha = on/off, animated
layer1 needles: brightness based on illumination and ambient light
